    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>This jeweled mask has 3 charges. As a Magic action, you can expend 1 charge to alter the look of your face. You can’t pass yourself off as a different person, but you can smooth or deepen your wrinkles, whiten your teeth, hide or emphasize the bags under your eyes, or make other small cosmetic changes. While your appearance is altered, the mask has the &amp;Reference[Invisible apply=false] condition. The change lasts 1 hour.</p><p><strong>Regaining Charges.</strong> The mask regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend its last charge, roll [[/r 1d20]]. On a 1, the mask bursts into a harmless cloud of sweet-smelling powder and is destroyed.</p>",
